{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202658TnpjnunR1793803545.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>金價重上4,000美元一盎司。</p><p></p><p>曾升至4,050美元水平，急升逾百分之3，見8月以來最大升幅。</p><p></p><p>美國中期選舉，據報民主黨取得參、眾議院控制權。選舉結果的不確定性逐步消退，美元和美債孳息率下跌，有利不能產生利息的黃金。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T15:45:40.827432+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T14:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T19:18:30.942697+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T15:38:29.230496+00:00","content_hash":"ff9af995e5b32622a78caab3bef2dec9ecc5ed0f376d5171eb4a5aa78493cd48","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}